   - **`Sources/ReachyUI/ReachyRootView.swift`** — added `showsRemoteRobots`, `remoteLink`, the `.sheet`, and:
     ```swift
     private func connectRemotely(to robot: CentralRobot) {
         showsRemoteRobots = false
